### File nay dung de THU API truc quan: mo bang VS Code (cai extension "REST Client")
### hoac Visual Studio, roi bam "Send Request" ngay tren tung dong ###.

@host = http://localhost:5113

### Danh sach san pham (du lieu that)
GET {{host}}/api/products

### Danh sach don hang
GET {{host}}/api/orders

### OCP - cac phuong thuc van chuyen
GET {{host}}/api/shipping/methods

### OCP - AP DUNG (Strategy): Express -> 30.000
GET {{host}}/api/shipping/fee-preview?method=Express&itemsAmount=450000

### OCP - AP DUNG: International (loai mo rong) -> 200.000
GET {{host}}/api/shipping/fee-preview?method=International&itemsAmount=450000

### OCP - VI PHAM (switch-case): Express -> 30.000
GET {{host}}/api/shipping/legacy-fee-preview?method=Express&itemsAmount=450000

### SRP - AP DUNG: dat hang chuan
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerName": "Le Van C", "email": "c@shop.vn", "productId": 1, "quantity": 2, "shippingMethod": 2 }

### SRP - VI PHAM: dat hang bang God class
POST {{host}}/api/orders/bad
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerName": "Bad Guy", "email": "bad@shop.vn", "productId": 4, "quantity": 1, "shippingMethod": 3 }

### LOI - san pham khong ton tai -> 404
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerName": "Nguyen Test", "email": "t@shop.vn", "productId": 999, "quantity": 1, "shippingMethod": 1 }

### LOI - vuot ton kho -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerName": "Nguyen Test", "email": "t@shop.vn", "productId": 3, "quantity": 50, "shippingMethod": 1 }
